# Permanent redirects for addresses that have moved: "<old path> <new path> 301", one per line.
# Read docs/URL_MIGRATION_REGISTRY.md before adding one: an old address goes to its own replacement (never the home page), the move is
# permanent (301), and `npm run check:urls` holds every line to that.
#
# The Design Lab was at /lab/ for a day before it moved to /design-lab/ (the address in the product spec).
/lab /design-lab/ 301
/lab/ /design-lab/ 301
/lab/* /design-lab/:splat 301
